    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain two additional specialized options when using your <strong>Brutal Strikes</strong> feature:</p><ul><li><strong>Concussive Rattle</strong>: The target must succeed on a <strong>Strength saving throw</strong> against your Program Save DC or <strong>lose its Reaction</strong> until the start of its next turn.</li><li><strong>Seismic Impact</strong>: Shockwaves blast out from your strike. Each creature of your choice within <strong>5 feet</strong> of the target takes damage equal to <strong>twice your Rage Damage bonus</strong>.</li></ul>"
